// Title: every collection intrinsic instance checks its prototype slot call
// in full (its synthetic spec has a fresh id, so no DefTable row), and
// GRAPHIX_ELAB_AUDIT reports it on any program that maps an array.
// Command: GRAPHIX_ELAB_AUDIT=1 graphix --no-cache c-lambda-collection-prototype-no-row.gx
// Expected: no ELAB-AUDIT line (no id is shared; the instance substitutes).
// Observed: "ELAB-AUDIT fallback at Unspecified:line: 1, column: 1
//   `("nop")(collection_element)`: no check-table row: checked in full", then [2, 3].
array::map([1, 2], |x| x + 1)
